{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19mini_level_act19mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act19mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "失剑客",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6ad7148e2db6278de9733129be175158a308382f52653f42519e187859c5924e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人，已经是第二天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您等的客人爽约了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许是遇上了什么事耽搁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在这等着不要紧，可我这小店还要打烊呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是嫌我白占了你一张桌子，我就出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我还是得待在门口......毕竟我和她约好的地方是这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你安心坐着吧！我能是那个意思？咱们的交情也不算浅了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一次见你的时候，我还只是个小堂倌呢，一转眼我都成这家茶馆的掌柜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来你这个人也真是奇怪，一个剑客，每年从......我又忘了，你是姜齐人还是玉门人来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居无定所，四海为家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我记得清楚，每年秋天这个时候，你都要专门跑来这个小镇，这个茶馆，和一个人见上一面——今年是第几年了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第七年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "七年了......你们每次见面也就是喝喝茶聊聊天，你们不是情人，不是朋友，你甚至连她的名字都不知道吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们有约在先，互不过问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是桩稀奇事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等的这一位，到底是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这辈子，和很多人打过交道，奸的恶的，善的蠢的......见得多了，便觉得这世上的人也没那么难懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独自饮酒的剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有她，我看不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......这位姑娘，你的剑把我的茶盏扫到地上了。\n这屋里狭小，随身带的剑还是要收好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不就是一杯茶，我赔你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再多送你一壶酒，算交你一个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交上朋友，也让你教我用剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我？哈哈哈......\n姑娘应该是找错人了，我就是个普普通通的商人。运点货去夕城，偶然经过这个镇子，喝杯茶歇歇脚，不是什么剑客。\n再说了，你看我身上哪有剑？哪有不带剑的剑客......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别装了，你不同意，我不会放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的堂倌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，这位姑娘，好好的你劈店里的桌子干嘛啊？其他客人都被吓跑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打坏的东西我一会自然会赔给你，不要破坏我和朋友聊天的兴致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再啰嗦，连你也劈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的堂倌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好嘞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......姑娘这般，倒是不讲道理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讲道理有什么意思？还是闯荡江湖逍遥自在有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是闯荡江湖，需要足够的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你的剑术很高明，所以想请你教我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "唉......\n姑娘想学剑，恐怕是来迟了一步。\n我的剑丢了......\n......从它消失不见的那一刻起，我便已经立誓，金盆洗手，永远不再卷入江湖事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的剑丢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "丢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么时候丢的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在昨晚。\n我刚在这小镇落脚，过了一夜，我的剑就不见了。\n的确是突然不见的。没有贼来过，也没有贼能带走我的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一柄怎样的剑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好剑。\n陪了我很多年，没有它，我做不了那么多生意，也挣不来如今在江湖上的名声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然是这么重要的东西，还不赶紧去找？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恰恰相反，我不能去找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这么多年过来，用剑、洗剑、再用剑，噩梦、清醒......我这辈子好像已经不剩下别的事情可做。\n剑不会记得它曾经沾染的血腥，但我没法摆脱那些罪孽......我刚刚一直在想，丢剑，或许正是老天给我的警示。\n我要摆脱那把剑，摆脱它带给我的身份，改头换面也好，找个地方孤老终生也好，我想要就此退隐江湖，了断此前的人生。\n所以姑娘，我教不了你。\n我们能在这间小小的茶馆相遇，是缘分。如果你不怪我好为人师，或许我能给你一句忠告......别学剑，也别入江湖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你丢不掉它的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为你在说假话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你厌倦了冤冤相报的杀戮，但你打心底放不下快意潇洒、敢爱敢恨的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是想为自己金盆洗手找个理由，丢了的剑恰好就成了你的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "姑娘说这些话，好像很了解我似的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打个赌吗？明年这个时候，我们依然在这间茶馆见面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你大可以按你的心意，过一年不用剑的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是你觉得那样的日子更快活，我就不再缠着你，也不用你教我剑法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过不管你教不教，我还是能自己学会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈哈哈......好，一言为定。\n不管教不教剑法，下次遇见姑娘，换我请姑娘喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini01_market"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原来姑娘已经到了......怎么不进茶馆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别急，这里地方宽敞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一年，我每天都在自己钻研剑法，琢磨出了不少招式，我演练一遍，你帮我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用你教，只是看看而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈哈......无妨，无妨。\n姑娘请吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......结束了，多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "姑娘为何要谢我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。没有你这个高手在场，我要怎么知道哪些招式值得改进，哪些招式应该重新想过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用你指点，甚至不用你说一句话，我只需要在练招时留心你的反应就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪几招精妙，哪几招还有漏洞，都能从你脸上看出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说是不愿再拿起剑，可看到没见过的剑法就像酒鬼遇见了酒，一点也藏不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像你这样的心性，行走江湖，容易吃亏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，姑娘说得一点也不差。\n有意思......嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你——药。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为你能撑着一直不喊疼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伤口笑裂了，一下子没忍住而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么受的伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "来之前，我在姜齐向主顾交付了这一季最后一批货物，出城的时候被一伙人拦住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯。\n几年前，我接了一单生意......事后我才知道，死在我剑下的家伙，我以为他是个为富不仁的人，但实际上也有不少人受过他的好。\n那伙人和他非亲非故，但有理由为他报仇。\n他们应该盯了我很久，直到确认我的剑丢了、我也很久不曾动过武，才敢来动手。\n......我费了很大一番功夫，才逃出来见你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过去这一年，你被寻仇的人找上了多少次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "记不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就一直逃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不逃的话不就被人杀死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的意思是说，你就算不用剑，也应该能杀死那些宵小之辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "冤冤相报何时了。杀光已有的仇家，又会结下新的仇家，仇家靠杀是杀不完的。\n我只能越陷越深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "江湖不就是如此？快意恩仇无怨无悔。直到某天，自己的剑慢了钝了，输给了更强的高手，那死了也就死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "见过人间险恶，也见过江湖风光，这样的日子有什么不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，你现在这样隐姓埋名忍气吞声地活着，就是你想要的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我还是觉得，丢剑是上天给我的警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不置可否地撇嘴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的堂倌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位，快进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的堂倌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的茶已经泡好，待会儿就凉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，喝完茶你就可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是，我才刚来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的剑术这一年长进不少，但你还没有想明白放下剑的日子该怎么过。我们去年打的赌，算我赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明年再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还活着呐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一年如何？我看你身上好像没受什么伤，是仇人变少了，还是你跑得更快了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini03_privateschool"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“刻舟求剑”？哈哈哈......这世上怎么还有这么蠢笨的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是说起来，我还从来没见过船，也没有见过大江奔流、怒海滔天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“接天莲叶无穷碧”......那是什么样的景象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini02_marketn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们明年再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啊，你来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经走近你身后不到两寸的距离，你都没有发现......如果我要杀你，这会儿已经得手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你现在动手还来得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你的注意力刚刚在别的东西上......让我看看你藏起了什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "欸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告示、悬赏、通缉令......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“渡魂剑”......这是你和你的剑的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你嘴上说着摆脱你的剑摆脱你的剑招，这几年一点点远离那个江湖，到头来却还是又犯下这么多事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是我，是“渡魂剑”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "过去几个月，沉寂多年的“渡魂剑”重新在江湖上活跃了起来，姜齐、琅珆、尚蜀、龙门......好几座移动城市都留下了他的踪迹......\n或者说，命案。\n去年我跟你说过，几个药材产区收成都不怎么样，我今年忙得焦头烂额，想要尽快把欠几个主顾的钱给还上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说，有人在冒用你的名头作恶，或者说，直接将脏水泼在你的身上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "出道二十多年，我接白道的任务，也做黑道的生意。我数不清有关我的布告和悬赏有多少，但有一点可以确认——\n不管那些人是想要博取世人的注意，还是掩盖自己真实的目的......“渡魂剑”这个名字都足够好用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，“渡魂剑”永远无法从江湖抽身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "多么可笑，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很在意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的剑已经消失六年了，这是上天给我的警示，让我远离这一切纷扰......我、我几乎快要成功了。\n最初踏进江湖的时候，只是想着，能凭一把剑养活自己，顺便做些好事，越往后，越身不由己。\n直到今天我才明白，江湖是一个漩涡，巨大的漩涡。摆脱它的方式只有一个——\n从一开始就不要踏进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很痛苦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我第一次见你这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是吗？或许吧。\n......别说我了，说说你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......刚刚近身，你确实有能力杀了我。\n这几年，你的武功确实精进了非常多。\n没有秘籍、没有老师，在这个小镇上，甚至找不出第二个练剑的人做你的对手，你全凭自己的颖悟达到如此境界......\n你甚至，对发生在我身上的这一切，并不感到惊讶和迷惑，你修心的造诣同样远超常人。\n记得第一次见面的时候，出于我个人的经历，我曾武断地尝试劝阻你习武练剑。但或许......\n或许你是个真正的天才，你本来就属于江湖。\n你应该离开这个小镇，去外面的天地闯荡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说的没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我，必须要做成的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "姑娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "坦白说，以你现在的武功，哪怕放眼整个江湖，也足以应付一般的高手。你早已不必在这个小镇踟蹰，真的想要动身，就趁早吧。\n我们相识一场，如果你愿意，我想要送你一份礼物——“渡魂剑”这个名字。\n你可以自称他的传人，甚至自称他本人，我甚至可以留给你一个信物以作凭证......江湖毕竟险恶，有了它，你会方便很多。\n姑娘，上路吧。我们一年一会的约定，也就到此为止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不到时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说，我还没找到办法离开这个小镇......但是快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我不太明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被漩涡扯住的人，不止你一个......明年见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可又过去了两个时辰，你们约定的最后时间早就过了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她还从来没有失约过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再、再等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人，要不你别等了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老早就发现你欲言又止了。掌柜的，知道什么，就说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等的那个家伙，现在是好几桩人命案子的凶手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之她把整个镇子弄得鳞飞兽跳，不得安生，大白天的都没人敢出门。你没发现我这茶馆生意都惨淡了好多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前段时间，终于有一位天师府来的天师经过这里，得知了这件事后正在全力追捕她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......她可能来不了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她虽然孤僻了一些，脾气古怪了一些，但不算太坏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说她在争夺一本绝世秘籍，应该能提升武功修为，或是还有什么别的作用，具体的我也不太懂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其实我有件事情一直想不通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她手里拿着的那把剑，并不寻常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据我所知，这里此前并没有习武的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样一个与世隔绝的小镇，一个土生土长的姑娘，是怎么接触到这些，又如此执着于剑术和江湖的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，土生土长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，她不是本地人。她是突然之间出现在镇子上的，没有人知道她叫什么名字，又来自哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌柜的，你还记得那是什么时候的事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想想啊......跟你第一次来这儿的时间差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那时候，我刚刚丢了我的剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么了这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini01_market"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是叫麟青砚吧，你就非要追着我不放？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "邪祟之物，做下许多恶事，理当俯首认罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你懂什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确实有很多疑问，宗师的《武典》究竟为什么出现在这里，你抢夺它的目的又是什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不拿下你，你是不愿意替我答疑解惑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废什么话，动手吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你失约了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为你已经走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“渡魂剑”郑愁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不记得自己做过和天师府相关的生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天师府，麟青砚。还在大理寺任职时，我看过你的卷宗，很厚。这几年，江湖上突然少了你的消息，想不到躲来了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兜兜转转，在这里遇见一位知道我底细的大理寺官员。说是要金盆洗手，到头来真成了个笑话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们俩是一伙的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？你没听他说吗，他正在金盆洗手，洗了七年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他和这本秘籍，和整件事无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他想要护你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "护我？不需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开吧，我自己能对付她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剑客没有挪动步子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好不容易摆脱你的剑，摆脱它带给你的身份，你用了整整七年来了断此前的人生，没必要在这里破戒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不过萍水相逢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得第一次见面时，你说......我丢不掉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如说，它一直还在我身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这个镇子上丢了剑，随后，你我相遇，你仿佛生来懂剑，甚至能通过观察我微小的反应来精进剑术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当然可以，我们曾形影不离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白当时到底发生了什么，你做那么多又是为了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，真笨啊，到现在才发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想还真好笑，去年我们见面的时候，你甚至还想着把“渡魂剑”这个名字送给我......明明，我就是它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个镇子很古怪，仿佛空气里有一股神秘的力量，器物受其感染，生出灵识，变成伥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茶壶、折扇、石头......路上走着的人里，十个有四个可能都是这些小玩意变的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经忘了是在什么时候意外和你分开，有记忆的时候，我便已经成了现在这副模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一路找去，终于在那间茶馆发现你。你从容地喝着一壶茶，没有半分着急的样子。我故意上前引起你的注意，而你跟我说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的剑消失了，这是上天给我的警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘，不，渡魂剑，不，我应该怎么称呼你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，别在心里想一些矫情的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个满手血腥的剑客想要改过自新，你的想法并没有错，说给对面那个臭脸的天师听，她说不定还会感叹一句“善莫大焉”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在那时突然意识到一件事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早已厌倦的江湖，我陪你看过走过......却从未亲身经历过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要习武练剑，我要自己成为剑客，江湖偌大，我要重新闯一遍——用我自己的名字！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可器物化成的伥，永远无法走出这个镇子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我试过很多次，东面的河流、西面的渡桥......镇子边缘似乎立着一堵只阻隔伥的墙壁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难怪你那时跟我说什么“还不到时候”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......果然如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你抢夺《武典》，是为了从宗师的功法中找到法子，突破这个镇子为伥设下的“屏障”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，蹊跷得很。你无从知晓宗师的身份，又怎会认为他的著书能有此作用......有人在利用伥的心性，挑起事端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天师大人，推理完了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜测过你可能是伥，但确实未曾想过你与“渡魂剑”郑愁之间有这样一段离奇的隐情......但这难以成为我审断你罪行的参考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了夺书，你搅起诸多祸端，理应受罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "束手就擒吧，免得雷法之下，神形俱灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "束手就擒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "秘籍在我手里，我很快就能参透其中的奥秘，离开这里......我为此努力了整整七年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没了持剑的人，没了剑鞘，谁还管得住剑的锋芒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有折断而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "静心运力，天雷自来。\n麟青砚的声音很小，但仿佛整个天地都在回应这位天师的号令。刚才还明亮的天色忽然就暗了，浓云密布，耀眼的电弧在她掌间聚集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麟天师，我不清楚事情怎么就成了如今这样，但......但她想要做的事情也不是不能理解，犯不着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我的剑，我、我愿意与她一同承担责任......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你滚开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痴愚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她渴望自由的心情，我并非不能理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是剑化身的伥，戾气难去，或许她自己都无法控制。她的渴望越是真切，我越是无法放任她离开，威胁到更多无辜的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将丢剑视作启示，立誓就此斩断恩怨，远遁江湖，本是好事。可这金盆洗手，一洗却是七年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇怨如雪落山谷，越积越深，可真下定了决心摆脱它，总是做得到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许她说得没错......在你的心里，你真的丢掉你的剑了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多说无益。无论是作为大理寺少卿，还是天师府传人——此雷当落则落！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "浓云与惊雷都已散去，那位持剑的女性也已经消失，天地复归澄明。\n麟青砚注意到，她原本站立的地方，一本装帧素朴的书籍正躺在那里，被风翻开了扉页——\n《武典》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（将《武典》盗出玉门的人或许也在这镇中，他究竟想做什么......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（暂时没有头绪，算了，先回收《武典》——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我好找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......槐天裴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眨眼间，街道上只剩下了剑客一个人。\n他呆呆地站在原地，良久不发一言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟，这一通闹腾啊......客人，你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我丢掉了我的剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年一会......以后都不会再有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位先生，请留步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，您认识我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我迷路了，不知道怎么就来到了这里，等了半天才等来您经过，想着问个路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（原来，麟天师当时是这个意思......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你的心里，你真的丢掉你的剑了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没法回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是麟天师，你未免太过无情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无情吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你仍想为她求情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年一会，已经是第七个年头。过去，我一直以为是我在开解她，可从来都是她在开解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我承认，我是个痴愚的人，我已经丢掉了剑，却又一次次将它捡了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道自己在留恋什么，或者在恐惧什么......或许这是我今后该去搞清楚的事情，在某个荒郊野村，或者大理寺的牢狱里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在镇上造成的一切损失，我会赔偿，随后我会自行去投案。只是在那之前，我恳求......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带剑的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（狂乱的呓语）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看她......她应该已经听不清你在说什么了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段时间，为了夺书，她频频动武，没有天雷催发，她也迟早有一天会被戾气侵占所有神识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕侥幸雷法剥离她身上所有的伥气，她也没法成为真正的“人”，健全地活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生灵多苦而多思，可器物化身的伥，深受器物之限，往往心思单纯......他们想要真正融入这世间，远比我们困难得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们该想想，将他们带入这世间，究竟是一种善意，还是一种残忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（麟青砚，或许事情结束后，你该向天师府请罪......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多说无益。无论是作为大理寺少卿，还是天师府传人——此雷当落则落！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您刚刚说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什么都不记得了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这条路往后，是一个小镇，往前，再走半天，就是驰道。沿着驰道，可以去很多移动城市，尚蜀啊、大荒城啊、琅珆啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要往哪儿走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想往哪儿走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂眉的女子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的身体不太好，但还是想去那些地方看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剑客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1866_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许，我们可以同行一段路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
